" Toggle group (<leader>T) ---------------------------------------------------
    " One place for on/off switches; every toggle echoes its new state.
    " The older keys (<leader>wp, <leader>sl, <F5>, ...) still work.
    " -- Options : Tw wrap, Ts spell, Tl list, Tc cursorline, Tv cursorcolumn,
    "              Te expandtab, Tp paste, Tn number, Tr relativenumber,
    "              Ta autochdir
